{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burrow is a game about digging up silly things in order to make money, and help rebuild a long-forgotten park to its former glory! Discover hidden secrets and explore the world while meeting new characters, and building your wealth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEST YOUR SKILLS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/457404eb940f3efdf1c5f0bb9544cdec.poster.avif?t=1764102654\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/457404eb940f3efdf1c5f0bb9544cdec.webm?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/457404eb940f3efdf1c5f0bb9544cdec.mp4?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digging is a test of timing, with rarer items getting increasingly difficult! Accuracy matters, as poor timing causes the item's quality to go down, or even break.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COSMETICS AND UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/a38263f66e96e721633920a1156782fc.poster.avif?t=1764102654\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/a38263f66e96e721633920a1156782fc.webm?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/a38263f66e96e721633920a1156782fc.mp4?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop from an ever-increasing catalogue of cosmetic items including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Eyes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Shirts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Mouths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Titles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Noses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Pants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Ears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Hats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With even more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or spend your money on new shovels with better stats, or charms to give you a boost in order to up your digging game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVER 25 ITEMS TO COLLECT (MORE TO COME!)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/bf96b0bdd9b96258451ce3e0e729b712.poster.avif?t=1764102654\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/bf96b0bdd9b96258451ce3e0e729b712.webm?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/bf96b0bdd9b96258451ce3e0e729b712.mp4?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item you find has a chance to be extremely large, or have valuable modifiers which exponentially increase the sell value! Do you have what it takes to discover all of the items?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MILESTONES WITH REWARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/b678a6220b0449acacf135b926c5266a.poster.avif?t=1764102654\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/b678a6220b0449acacf135b926c5266a.webm?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/b678a6220b0449acacf135b926c5266a.mp4?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete milestones to get unique rewards and boost your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a lot of inspiration from Webfishing, and I fully acknowledge that. I hope to further build this game into its own, more unique visual identity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109940?t=1764102654","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109940?t=1764102654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/8e1a23f0443bc862195ec890b747df7279d05859/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764102654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/8e1a23f0443bc862195ec890b747df7279d05859/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764102654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burrow is a game about digging up silly things in order to make money, and help rebuild a long-forgotten park to its former glory! Discover hidden secrets and explore the world while meeting new characters, and building your wealth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEST YOUR SKILLS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/457404eb940f3efdf1c5f0bb9544cdec.poster.avif?t=1764102654\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/457404eb940f3efdf1c5f0bb9544cdec.webm?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/457404eb940f3efdf1c5f0bb9544cdec.mp4?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digging is a test of timing, with rarer items getting increasingly difficult! Accuracy matters, as poor timing causes the item's quality to go down, or even break.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COSMETICS AND UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/a38263f66e96e721633920a1156782fc.poster.avif?t=1764102654\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/a38263f66e96e721633920a1156782fc.webm?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/a38263f66e96e721633920a1156782fc.mp4?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop from an ever-increasing catalogue of cosmetic items including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Eyes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Shirts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Mouths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Titles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Noses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Pants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Ears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Hats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With even more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or spend your money on new shovels with better stats, or charms to give you a boost in order to up your digging game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVER 25 ITEMS TO COLLECT (MORE TO COME!)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/bf96b0bdd9b96258451ce3e0e729b712.poster.avif?t=1764102654\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/bf96b0bdd9b96258451ce3e0e729b712.webm?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/bf96b0bdd9b96258451ce3e0e729b712.mp4?t=1764102654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item you find has a chance to be extremely large, or have valuable modifiers which exponentially increase the sell value! Do you have what it takes to discover all of the items?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MILESTONES WITH REWARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/b678a6220b0449acacf135b926c5266a.poster.avif?t=1764102654\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109940/extras/b678a6220b0449acacf135b926c5266a.webm?t=1764102654\" typ